PROVENANCE
----------
data/raw/bbb.csv derives from the in-vivo logBB dataset published in:

  M. Dichiara, B. Amata, R. Turnaturi, A. Marrazzo, and E. Amata,
  "Tuning properties for blood-brain barrier permeation: a statistics-based
  analysis," ACS Chem. Neurosci., vol. 11, no. 1, pp. 34-44, 2020.
  doi: 10.1021/acschemneuro.9b00541

It is redistributed here for reproducibility only. The terms of the original
publication apply to the underlying measurements; the CC BY 4.0 license above
covers this repository's curation and derived files.

NOTE: the code in this repository is licensed separately, under the MIT
license in ../LICENSE.
